%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/dQytvRXomDX9f2gqtfXADHEfxLLp0O64.ogg"},{"description":"Nodoka_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"あっ……あそこにも！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/U2rjonlFpfww3l83wtZTm9gb4c4BHcJs.ogg"},{"description":"Nodoka_MemorialLobby_1_3","category":"lobby","text":"そっちにも！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/V3jIuWHwvkmg8ZkAwgVxomkiYwhkbjmQ.ogg"},{"description":"Nodoka_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"空に流れ星がいっぱいです！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/Ujw9At5DOvMaLf0NUx4w4AfobqXBdIuC.ogg"},{"description":"Nodoka_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"流星が本当に、雨のように降ってますね！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/kDEeVyH64cRai5rQ15dIC0aiBi9aikmo.ogg"},{"description":"Nodoka_MemorialLobby_2_3","category":"lobby","text":"こんなに美しい光景を実際に見られるなんて…… 本当に、夢みたいです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/jFSSrfcItTlV2gWlTPy277ZDfTHEramq.ogg"},{"description":"Nodoka_MemorialLobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"願い事ですか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/w0EeUKjWwzPewTedekszLbrXGLaDPCrd.ogg"},{"description":"Nodoka_MemorialLobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"いえ……今日は、大丈夫です。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/tfVmkQXRqLzyMnrdVLyohdozK020TdwF.ogg"},{"description":"Nodoka_MemorialLobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"好きな人と一緒に、こんなに綺麗な星空を見ることができているのに、 これ以上願い事をしたら、なんだかお星様に叱られてしまいそうで……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/sgl33ibEbkr9YapNQZK4h5Z4XonsvXTT.ogg"},{"description":"Nodoka_MemorialLobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"今日はこれだけで