n_in_1","category":"formation","text":"您，您，您这么信任我吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/AOQ4gZNmWr8LIZ7YU0wjJ3uScOCta0OC.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"像我这种人，您不介意的话……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/qtTBrHwrG3RB9yDVu2qCcN68T4s755gK.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"您就是，我一直在用望远镜观察的，那位老师吗……？啊！好激动啊……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/HU0sTvAo4TUz7512QPzAur3aiESTUAbi.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"视野一下子变得更清晰了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/9Wd3g1HVykbJ8oRtsUfPU2cSntDTyPGt.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"只要这样，就能更清楚地看到老师的一举一动了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/FO2YNFKO7rDYdP4tiVC2rDqC4XvRP7A9.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"谢谢老师，今后我也会更加更加努力地去观察！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/tdvFCDTJYZXqeCWxQhx7Ou8nG8ZaUqJn.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"继续这样努力，总有一天可以离开特别班吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/BqG1dA0FcKsplZNugF9uXnwSVfKltWSq.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"嗯，嗯哼哼……还是盯着老师看的时候最开心了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/SCGttiJK926FffsbxPvuaRlQ1hbqZ4ys.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯哼哼……老师的脸真是怎么看都看不腻呢！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/POdUuMUl0LqChMNscx3kJU92tJ9ip7f9.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"唔……我可不是对谁都这样的哦？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/sWbgvnQj4IhrE5HRqdwHPAQgYjoqR2EN.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"望着这浩瀚的宇宙…… 我再一次感受到，人生是多么的虚幻。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/R23n8T4CApml7TulNHQfz4rVH9Aytx4w.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"呵呵，希望有一天可以跟老师一起去观察夜空。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/5ebSzoKpwfcvcesUi5KxBrBM3LmvDLJZ.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"我就知道您马上会回来！ 因为……我一直在盯着您呐！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/MeppfPzIpxNeiQvivFY4IxwfWpoP0cUr.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"咦？老师刚刚还在那儿呢…… 哎！吓我一跳！您，您什么时候过来的？没没没有，我可没有监视您哦！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/RDgA7lKXFPTuQCsnSU6A9Rmq5wT1xiei.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"哇，流星来了耶！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/mh8W81hGttYeRiFeJSmMovGONbnnxFS4.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊哈……那边也有！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/mAjUUhJCcZw2RlQa5zthHVDSAVNMitRS.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_memoriallobby_1_3","category":"lobby","text":"还有那边！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/dY1V7dOxhXgSl3ySCDAks61XoDEiQOol.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"天上真的全部都是流星耶！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/MREMPlROfnGQx3oEg4fKMdGqSh2IfLAx.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"流星就像下雨似的往下掉呢！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/8MURhLEf43t8oYbal6w4XWp4l28n608k.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_memoriallobby_2_3","category":"lobby","text":"我居然能够亲眼看到这么美的景色……真的和做梦一样。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/SEoYtATaqi3bjW6SV0WaFKQIbGSHtwnL.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"您说许个愿？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/VlvhVnUQHFTU9hSEYOJhJUy7ADlFvKxh.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯不……今天就不用了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/fSHge5BXYs2jRv3IV3jo5QiCvbwFxdpg.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"都能和喜欢的人在一块儿抬头仰望这么美丽的星空了。还要再贪心许愿，总感觉要被小星星们骂的……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/qufPMJMOWyoF2uSFhU86t2Hn5fAdGK4Y.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"今天这样，我已经很满足了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/fhB1tD0Gga5cu5sw72n2hJfI5zsr7DdB.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"嘿嘿嘿，像这样和老师面对面的说话，还真有点不好意思呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/SOp5YgFEFSfZMp0QNW2rSIr3PqLiYMR0.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"只要和老师在一起，就算是这种极寒天气也不可怕了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/WaKXkQVqIf0YNBOR02u1E5VAmdEbWjmD.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"我想知道更多更多关于老师的事情！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/0ZQ7rROx4bH0VxU6MV0tqzDzMAeXLh7K.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"老师，今晚的月色真美啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/PpQrJpNqpY8fRRsXxZWiDsibyiWWLLTf.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"老师，您知道吗？在我生日那晚仰望星空， 可以看到相亲相爱的双子星划过南方的天际。那一天就是…… 就是今天！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/STLahU7UbxoTW32S20yLsqLsypZdjxq7.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"老师，祝您生日快乐！ 今天一天我都会认真地守护您，保证不会发生任何不好的事情！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/konB6SBmZdam84irnPQHmDYKj7IaFQGa.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"老师，要和我一起去看星星吗？如果我们发现了流星，那一整年都会有好运哦！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/L3yf0eoy7F4pJAHVPVXmrbzdRPT88X9E.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"今年的万圣节，会不会给我们发糖果呢……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/20gimUi3CuReTOhSBRveUJRGpud1ETX6.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"老师，今晚和我一起在旧楼赏月吧，我可以把天文望远镜借给你。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/1fcTm0Lh4BcAKzOLfTx0HrgXzLeaIMql.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"希望我今年可以离开这里，回到主楼……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/Jz4gKbCaegWDkdeaAB96a8BLVJu6xDsO.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"从远处望去，圣诞节的夜景 就像闪耀着星光的夜空一样，真美啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/3ELHFGugEkdiM5BnezV6aglMZcUeaBzB.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_title","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/biJD8UTeIi3J1qSo370yvMrVdYaiRJUj.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_battle_in_1","category":"battle","text":"我会执行好观测任务的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/AuAcMtuv5tdomIUAHFC6EQLAnYHhwlgw.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_battle_in_2","category":"battle","text":"我不会看漏任何一个敌人！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/g1QfVgeH0dTSuW2uztw6JZR2vZ2CYPK2.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_cafe_act_1","category":"cafe","text":"这里布置得好漂亮啊~","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/t6IBdxnhXf1oWN4QtmN76Eyyr02Q9ybl.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_cafe_act_2","category":"cafe","text":"老师……人在哪里呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/O28gd4cLWgEujq5TIKXbFF2KF4Xhaobq.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"嘿嘿，发现了好漂亮的家具！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/iDD4DjWbebRzWBpmKR7QxKVLEMUGBB33.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"那边会有什么呢……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/VjwqcLAalXPvm3FKwVZWoU77rD43PJI1.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"一定要逃出特别班……越快越好……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/Hm0duhpSJXUokh64ePk5fxUavehYtMVo.ogg"},{"description":"nodoka_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"嘿嘿嘿，我全都看光光了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A7%81%20%E5%92%8C%E9%A6%99/qvKxGgjxoow5WDPc9gySQAzYUJGB4VGG.ogg"},